{"id":"crab-grab","title":"Crab Grab!","level":2,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"5d8c81213182770bcc326abefbda05ee","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["crab","grab","chips","gull","splash","stuck","fresh"],"common":["the","of","go","my","no","he"],"challenge":["after"],"before":"What do you think a crab might grab?","after":["What did the gull take?","Why did Dash jump into the rock pool?","How did Logan get the crab to let go?","How do you think the gull felt at the end?"],"retell":[3,5,7,10,11,14],"pages":[{"text":"Logan, Anastasia and Dash dig in the sand.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b3e19c09a88f363522873d1b86c25a17","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A sunny British beach with a pier and colourful beach huts in the distance.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad has a bag of chips. Yum!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"503656367e904d4d89d92b35dd33c34c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad relaxes in a striped deckchair with an open paper bag of hot chips, eyes closed and smiling.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"A big gull swoops down. Grab!","bubble":{"who":"dad","name":"Dad","text":"Stop! My chips!","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"b983a24f850e24e6c280fd01d557ac0e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A cheeky seagull swoops down, wings spread, and snatches a chip from the bag.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash runs after the gull.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"99163ce93764cfe65e1c52af9a31c993","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash sprints across the sand after the low-flying seagull, his little legs a blur, a determined look on his face.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The gull drops the chip. Plop! It lands in a rock pool.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"6ce31cd5941cacf4add0ab53c6856910","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The chip falls from the gull's beak into a clear rock pool among seaweed-covered rocks.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash jumps in to get it. Splash!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"f9808674d11e90a5588aa950d4da3659","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash dives head first into the rock pool after the chip, water splashing up.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Snap! A crab grabs Dash's tail.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"2b9e0f3a17da01e37bf4cc8e7590949d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A red crab clamps its claw on Dash's tail.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash is stuck!","bubble":{"who":"dash","name":"Dash","text":"Help! Help!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"82dafc0e9fc6fbcda1eeaed41aaeeec1","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash wriggles in the rock pool, waving his arms, while the crab holds on tight to his tail.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan and Anastasia run to the rock pool.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"5e863e3aff3e22368b3ef27fffb5cfec","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia race across the sand towards the rocks, Anastasia holding a fishing net and Logan holding a bucket.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan has a plan. He grabs the chip.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"66b06225f00e51e682473c4d3bb79d57","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan crouches at the rock pool, reaching in to pick up the floating chip with a clever smile.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The crab lets go of Dash. It grabs the chip!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"aa8938ad3657f0399bdbd9ab9925fd11","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan dangles the chip over the water.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash is free! Anastasia hugs him.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b887de12bb092e436b0f49d7a8e8f458","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia hugs a soggy, happy Dash wrapped in a beach towel.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad gets a fresh bag of chips.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"3439443b9d48d26c6b58f9e5c5d5ae9f","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Back at the deckchairs, Dad holds a new paper bag of chips and the whole family sits together in the sunshine.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash sits on top of the bag. No gull will get them now!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"cfd60420ea07c0da8ecd2b46c2c16a93","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash stands guard on top of the chip bag with folded arms, wearing tiny sunglasses and a stern face.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}